      "title": "Zeckendorf Representation",
      "solution": "f=[1,2]\nwhile f[-1]<1000: f.append(f[-1]+f[-2])\nn=int(input())\nres=[]\nfor i in range(len(f)-1,-1,-1):\n    if f[i]<=n:\n        res.append(str(i+1)); n-=f[i]\nprint(' '.join(res))",
